    developmentAreas: ['Mathematics'],
    subDevelopmentAreas: ['Fractions'],
    description: 'What is it?\n• The child fetches the insets and the packet of printed addition problems (these problems only use fractions with the same denominator as addends).\n• The child builds each of the addends separately and then pushes them together and counts them to find his answer.\n• He records the whole equation on his paper.\n• He can draw and solve as many problems as he wants.\nWhy do we do it?\n• See Making Designs\nHow to help at home?\n• See Making Designs',
