    description: 'What is it?\n• See Wooden Hierarchical Material: Introduction to Quantity\n• The children take out the numerals and the wooden material.\n• They label all the wooden material with the cards. The adult only stays by to help if needed.\nWhy do we do it?\n• See Wooden Hierarchical Material: Introduction to Quantity',
