    description: 'What is it?\n• The child gets out the teens boards and the colored bead stair with the ten bars.\n• The guide builds 11 with the beads next to the boards and adds the 1 card to the board to make it read 11.\n• The child then repeats this with the rest of the teens.\n• She can play this game as much as she\'d like, mixing up the order of the numerals.\n• If she needs more help the adult can play more games with her until she is secure with the numerals and quantities 11-19.\nWhy do we do it?\n• Association of the quantity, mane, and symbol for the teens (11-19).\nHow to help at home?\n• See previous Teen lessons.',
