    developmentAreas: ['Practical Life'],
    subDevelopmentAreas: ['Care of the Environment'],
    description: 'What is it?\n• The child uses cotton balls and water to gently wipe the leaves of plants in the classroom.\nWhy do we do it?\n• Fine motor control\n• Manual dexterity\n• Hand-eye coordination\n• Motive for repetition, concentration, and exactness\n• Care of the environment\n• Indirect preparation for botany',
    mediaThumbUrl: 'https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/masterproject-a832a.appspot.com/o/amsCurriculum%2Flessons%2F18036434.jpeg?alt=media&token=013a845a-041e-556c-a113-313b6a138b5d',
