    title: 'Adjective Command Cards',
    ageBand: 'Elementary (6-12)',
    developmentAreas: ['Language'],
    subDevelopmentAreas: ['Parts of Speech: The Adjective'],
    description: 'What is it?\n• These printed cards give simple instructions for the children to follow.\nWhy do we do it?\n• Further practice with nouns and adjectives.\n• To develop reading comprehension, as following the commands requires understanding the text first.\n• Sensorial experience of different types of adjectives.\n• To draw the child\'s attention to patterns in our language.\nSupporting interest at home:\n• See Parts of Speech.',
