    description: 'What is it?\n• Using the prepared sentences in the grammar box, the children make each sentence with prepared cards, act out the sentence, and symbolize each word.\nWhy do we do it?\n• To learn the name and symbol (a small orange circle) for the adverb.\n• To practice with the function of the adverb.\n• For children to understand and use adverbs in their writing.\n• To aid in reading comprehension.\n• To draw attention to patterns in our language.\nSupporting interest at home:\n• See Parts of Speech.',
