    ageBand: 'Elementary (6-12)',
    developmentAreas: ['History'],
    subDevelopmentAreas: ['The Exercises for Time: The Calendar'],
    description: 'What is it?\n• Children create a timeline of their own life and the lives of their family members.\nWhy do we do it?\n• For the child to recognize how time moves in their own life.\n• This can bring exposure to sequence, how time is spent, and skills to make a timeline.\nSupporting interest at home:\n• Share stories from your past.\n• Encourage your child to ask for stories from older relatives.',
