    subDevelopmentAreas: ['The Plant'],
    description: 'What is it?\n• In this experiment, generally given to older children, we explore the macro-nutrients required to keep a plant healthy.\nWhy do we do it?\n• Provide children an experience linking chemistry and botany.\nSupporting interest at home:\n• A visit to a plant nursery or garden supplies store to look at chemical composition of fertilizers and other soil amendments.',
    mediaThumbUrl: 'https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/masterproject-a832a.appspot.com/o/amsCurriculum%2Flessons%2F18035879.jpeg?alt=media&token=2a2c288d-e367-59b3-a642-3c3659c35227',
